  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/underground-village,-stoneholm/version/cg6QT9XM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/KmyhssPl?color=34D058&amp;label=Modrinth下载量&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underground-villages-stoneholm/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1123746?color=FC7303&amp;label=CurseForge下载量&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/underground_village-neo-forge?color=6E40C9&amp;label=问题反馈&amp;logo=github\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/CN962KMpJk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/430776550443581450?color=5865F2&amp;label=在线用户&amp;logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1123746/description_88a3d82d-4ba5-4d0b-8666-efc74536ed10.png\"></a></strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>鸣谢赞助商</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感谢ZAP-HOSTING！使用优惠码Reggarf-1047可享全场8折！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1123746/description_18e17554-3893-489e-b435-8febf11b584c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<h2>模组介绍</h2>\n<p>本模组是经典模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneholm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Stoneholm</a>的重制版，适配1.20.1至1.21.1版本</p>\n<section>\n<p><strong>Stoneholm</strong>为世界添加了由错综复杂的走廊与楼层构成的地下迷宫，带来全新类型的地下村庄。</p>\n<p>你可以探索这些令人晕头转向的走廊，将整个地下村庄改造成自己的家园；或是在地面上建造基地，把村民永远囚禁在地底；当然也可以绑架村民来实现你那些\"绝对正当\"的目的。<br><br></p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"506\"><strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"184\">探索脚下隐藏的地下世界！</strong><br data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"187\"><em data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"221\">地下村庄 - Stoneholm</em>为你的世界添加了程序生成的地下村庄群落，这些村庄坐落在蜿蜒的地下洞窟中。这些地下定居点为生存模式玩家提供了全新的沉浸式体验，特别适合热爱探索与建筑奇观的玩家。</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"759\">村民们在这些地下城镇中开凿出了精妙的厅堂、住宅、农场和会议室，配合照明与装饰让地底世界充满生机。这里是寻找庇护所、进行交易的全新方式，甚至可以作为你建造基地的起点。</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"786\">🔧 完全可配置</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"895\">根据你的世界需求自定义体验！本模组提供完整的配置支持，你可以：</p>\n<ul data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"983\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"983\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"921\">调整村庄规模</strong>，打造温馨小聚落或巨型地下城</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1098\"><strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1041\">设置最大生成距离</strong>，控制地下村庄的生成范围</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1258\">无论你是在制作冒险地图、调整生存世界，还是单纯想要更沉浸的村民体验，<em data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1234\">Stoneholm</em>都能满足你的需求。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923212424417361/pBsb5j2.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=a9de1f687e484d810385cff4061b8816fea7b9b9c21b5e173a3066dad3955a5a&amp;\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923211744808970/pw8F7p0.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=3cca3f02110888aee721ef3aa8a195df1eb275d014ac696f4ad29c6c85204cdf&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923211086434404/321lqSj.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=5885117d6e7b747e7c332a0f8020b85f0cb5766e1589b5d1614ce58dad9297c2&amp;\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923210570268732/5Jj3fDJ.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=4756b0c8864bdc98b437d67733205dc6e9883133f1c5439905c485826a941ef2&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></h3>\n</blockquote>\n</section>",
